PARITY_COVERED=44
(all 34 keys confirmed present in apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings with en source
 values ported verbatim from the web `t(key, default)` calls; +1 route.periodCompare="Period
 Comparison" nav title; +1 spotlight.route.periodCompare.description; 36 keys inserted, JSON
 re-validated → 9501 total keys.)

Data sources: useVehicles → GET /vehicles  (PeriodCompareDataSource.loadVehicles); the page also
binds the period-stats query (GET /analytics/period-stats, web raw `request()`) via
PeriodCompareDataSource.loadPeriodStats(vehicleID:days:) — both surface loading/empty/error/success.
Web hook name preserved at the Swift seam: `loadVehicles` ↔ useVehicles.
Units: SI on the model (meters / Wh / Wh-km); converted at the render boundary via Units (P1/S5) +
PeriodCompareFormat (no non-SI stored/computed). Energy displays kWh exactly like the web
(preference-independent), distance/efficiency follow useUnits.
a11y: TSPageTitle/PanelTitle headers, chart accessibilityLabel+Value summary, metric cards
.accessibilityElement(.combine); Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens; light/dark via Color.TS tokens.
Adaptive: selectors + metric grid reflow compact(iPhone)/regular(macOS,iPad) via horizontalSizeClass.

